 to nine a perpetual foil  for dan's advances and a romantic  interest for harry christine is smart  witty and amusingly flustered thanks to  post-comic timing  much like harry idolizes mel tormey  christine too has a quirk  she adores the royal family and princess  diana collecting memorabilia such as  porcelain thimbles  christine is honest to a fault although  she does flash a guy to help harry win  an arm wrestling contest  she becomes disillusioned and considers  quitting her job soon after arriving in  season three when a man  mugs her but when the same mugger winds  up taking hostages at the courthouse  christine rediscovers her compassion and  helps save the day  the series n sees the impassioned and  creative defense attorney off to  congress  b-movie veteran richard mole had shaved  his head for a role when he auditioned  for night court  the producers liked the bald look so  much on the six foot seven inch mole  that they asked him to keep that style  for bailiff nostradamus bull shannon  bull is fiercely protective of harry and  can seem dim-witted at times  although mold played this with a gentle  and child-like nature bull's towering  size means that he often wrangles rowdy  defendants  something that makes him consider a  wrestling promoter's job offer in season  2  after he corrals guest star lou ferrigno  fortunately harry and the others  convince him to return to the courthouse  instead of pursuing a career in the ring  and probably the end of nightcourt sees  aliens whisk bull off to jupiter so he  can help short aliens reach things on  high shelves  since then mole has appeared in but i'm  a cheerleader and scary movie 2.  he's also voiced various animated  villains including two-face and batman  the animated series  scorpion and spider-man the animated  series and the abomination in the  incredible hulk  accompanying bull as the older and wiser  bailiff on night courts are three women  scattered throughout the show's tenure  the deadpan's selma 